[ti:Kaa Rahasya]
[ar:VESAHE · hkfaduio]
[al:Cinematic & Other]
[by:Radio Vaigyaaniq — draft timing, unverified]
[00:08.00]k..
[00:11.17]ka...
[00:14.35]kaa...
[00:17.52]kaaa...
[00:20.70]kyaa...
[00:23.87]ka kau ke
[00:27.04]ken kabhyaam kai
[00:30.22]kavim kaviim kavayah
[00:33.39]kahaam katham kathaam
[00:36.57]kasmin kyo keshu
[00:39.74]ka kaa rahasya niraalaa
[00:42.92]kya kaun kab kaise kahan
[00:46.09]nai brahmaand racha daalaa
[00:49.26]e mera naanak we matwaalaa
[00:52.44]kaa de chakkar k nu dala
[00:55.61]kada kachcha karpaan kanghi kesh
[00:58.79]sakkhe purus nu ditte bhesh
[01:01.96]chanddalaa de dna nai
[01:05.13]onnu wi dohkaa de daalaa
[01:08.31]ka... kaa... kya... kyo...
[01:11.48]kahan kab tak kisko kyon
[01:14.66]khalq khuda kufr karam
[01:17.83]khoon kaleje kaa, kaghaz kalam
[01:21.00]khaali karo kya kahe kabeer
[01:24.18]kankar kaahe karein taqeer
[01:27.35]kuttaa kaalaa kya jaane
[01:30.53]kaaba kaun, kaun but-khaana
[01:33.70]kaafir kahe kaaba chale
[01:36.88]qazi kahe qabar chale
[01:40.05]kaa de chakkar mein kaalaa phire
[01:43.22]kaal kaa kaal kahaan se tire
[01:46.40]kadaa na toota, kes na kaate
[01:49.57]kanghi na rukhi, karpaan na haathe
[01:52.75]kachcha kaahe kaa rakhdaa baandh
[01:55.92]kaal kaa khel, na jaane aadh
[01:59.09]khaak se kaaya, kaaya se kaam
[02:02.27]kaam se krodh, krodh se jaam
[02:05.44]kaun si kaayaa kaahe si kathaa
[02:08.62]kaa kaa rahasya – bas kaal kaa naath
[02:11.79]kahaam gaye sab kavim kaviim
[02:14.96]kavayah kaahe bane nayeem
[02:18.14]kasmin jag mein kyo nahi chain
[02:21.31]keshu hi to hai maaya mail
[02:24.49]ka kau ke – teeno paal
[02:27.66]ken kabhyaam – dohe ka jaal
[02:30.84]kai – kaahe ko kai baar
[02:34.01]kathaam katham – kahta hai koi bichaar
[02:37.18]ka kaa rahasya – kya bataaye
[02:40.36]kya likhe kaghaz kya mitaaye
[02:43.53]jeh kavan kahan kis karan
[02:46.71]so kaal – so khaas – so khanjar – so kiran
